<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  p, td, span { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <p>Handout #2</p>
  <h2>Instructions for Employees to Complete Recognize Excellence and Development (RED) Employee Information, Supervisor Information, Objectives and Self-Assessment</h2>
  <p>On the Formstack Form for Recognize Excellent and Development (RED) enter the required demographic information. <strong>Note:</strong> Some of the information will be pre-filled for you. Any field marked with an asterisk requires you to enter information; otherwise, you will not be able to submit the form.</p>

  <h3>Employee's Information</h3>
  <p>Enter the following on the RED Form:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Your <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>, <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>, <span data-field="job_title">{{ job_title }}</span>, <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span> (confirm your email address) and <span data-field="employee_id">{{ employee_id }}</span>. <strong>Note:</strong> You can find your XID number on your pay statement above your name and SSN.</li>
    <li>Select your <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span> from the drop-down menu.</li>
    <li>Leave blank the field that asks for the <span data-field="period_check_in_date">{{ period_check_in_date }}</span> since this is the final assessment.</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>Recognize Excellence and Development (RED) Employee Information</p>
    <p>For instructions, click on an icon for the relevant stage of the performance cycle below to learn more.</p>
    <img src="placeholder_icon_1.png" alt="Icon 1" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <p>Please complete all information below:</p>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;">Employee's Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;"><span data-field="employee_first_name">{{ employee_first_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;"><span data-field="employee_last_name">{{ employee_last_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px;">Employee's Title:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="employee_title">{{ employee_title }}</span></td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;">Employee's Email:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="employee_email">{{ employee_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px;">Employee S. Number:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="employee_s_number">{{ employee_s_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Note: For tips on how to write the objectives/key responsibilities, click on the arrow in the RED Form itself labeled <span data-field="beginning_of_performance_cycle">{{ beginning_of_performance_cycle }}</span>.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p>Handout #2</p>
  <ol start="4">
    <li>Enter your supervisor's <span data-field="supervisor_first_name">{{ supervisor_first_name }}</span>, <span data-field="supervisor_last_name">{{ supervisor_last_name }}</span>, and <span data-field="supervisor_email">{{ supervisor_email }}</span> (confirm the email address). <strong>Note:</strong> It is important that you enter your supervisor's St. John's email address because when you submit the form, the form will be sent to the email address of the supervisor whose name you entered onto the form.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Recognize Excellence and Development (RED) Supervisor Information</h3>
  <p>Please complete all information below:</p>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;">Supervisor's Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;"><span data-field="supervisor_first_name">{{ supervisor_first_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 33%; padding: 5px;"><span data-field="supervisor_last_name">{{ supervisor_last_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px;">Supervisor's Email:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="supervisor_email">{{ supervisor_email }}</span></td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;">Confirm Supervisor's Email:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="supervisor_email_confirmation">{{ supervisor_email_confirmation }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Please enter your supervisor's St. John's University email address.</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>Note: For tips on how to write the objectives/key responsibilities, click on the arrow in the RED Form itself labeled <span data-field="beginning_of_performance_cycle">{{ beginning_of_performance_cycle }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <h3>Employee's Objectives/Key Responsibilities</h3>
  <p>Please enter the Objectives/Key Responsibilities set by you and your supervisor at the beginning of the performance cycle.</p>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <img src="placeholder_icon_2.png" alt="Icon 2" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <p>Click the relevant icon below for tips on how to complete this section:</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3>5. Write down the objectives (one objective per box) that reflects the major work performed during the reporting cycle. <strong>Note:</strong> You should have between 3-5 major objectives.</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>#1 Objective/Key Responsibility*</p>
    <p>Describe the overall goal, deliverable, or outcome. What is the expected result? What is the scope of the objective? What are the key results that will be measured? (e.g., Improve customer satisfaction scores by 10% by Q4.)</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>#2 Objective/Key Responsibility*</p>
    <p>Describe the overall goal, deliverable, or outcome. What is the expected result? What is the scope of the objective? What are the key results that will be measured? (e.g., Complete the certification tracking project so that each active administrator and staff member has a completed profile established in the RED spreadsheet by March 31.)</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>#3 Objective/Key Responsibility*</p>
    <p>Describe the overall goal, deliverable, or outcome. What is the expected result? What is the scope of the objective? What are the key results that will be measured? (e.g., Develop and pilot Adapting to Change by August 31, 2021. Train 12 people by 01/31/2022 with a very good/excellent rating of at least 80%.)</p>
  </div>

  <p><strong>Note:</strong> Although you are not asked to rate yourself on the competencies, you should view the list of competencies to address when writing your self-assessment. You can find the <span data-field="list_of_competencies">{{ list_of_competencies }}</span> on the HR Services webpage in the RED Section. Your supervisor will add the ratings for the competencies.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Competencies</h3>
  <p><strong>Note:</strong> Competencies #8 & 9 are for administrators who supervise non-supervisory administrators and staff.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>1. Provide Timely and Excellent Service:</h4>
      <p>Demonstrates reliability, maintains effectiveness when faced with challenges, and consistently delivers high-quality service to others.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>4. Adapting to Change:</h4>
      <p>Demonstrates resilience, maintains effectiveness when faced with challenges, and consistently adapts to new processes and environments.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>2. Diversity and Inclusivity:</h4>
      <p>Demonstrates the ability to communicate across differences to create a collaborative, collegial, and caring community. Actively seeks and values diverse perspectives.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>5. Collegiality and Teamwork:</h4>
      <p>Works collaboratively and respectfully within and across departments.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>3. Shared Ownership/Accountability:</h4>
      <p>Understands and takes responsibility for individual role in achieving departmental/university-wide objectives.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>6. Communication:</h4>
      <p>Communicates clearly, concisely, and respectfully in all interactions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>7. Quality of Work:</h4>
      <p>Provides accurate complete products and services.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>8. People Management:</h4>
      <p>Communicates with employees to set expectations, mentor, coach, support, and lead teams.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>9. Planning and Strategic Vision:</h4>
      <p>Develops plans to support business unit objectives.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3>6. On the RED Form, there is space to enter the steps you have taken to enhance skills/knowledge and abilities during the past year. Identify the skill, the action to be taken and the results i.e., if the action was completed during the past year. <strong>Provide this information on your RED Form. Note:</strong> Also, think of additional development opportunities to add to the RED Form for the next year.</h3>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>Professional Development Plan</p>
    <p>Click the icon below for tips on how to complete this section</p>
    <img src="placeholder_icon_3.png" alt="Icon 3" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background-color: #f2f2f2;">
        <th style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Skills/Knowledge/Abilities to be developed (or improved)</th>
        <th style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Action steps/Timeline</th>
        <th style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: left;">Results/Actions taken</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_1_skill">{{ development_item_1_skill }}</span></td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_1_action">{{ development_item_1_action }}</span></td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_1_result">{{ development_item_1_result }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_2_skill">{{ development_item_2_skill }}</span></td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_2_action">{{ development_item_2_action }}</span></td>
        <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><span data-field="development_item_2_result">{{ development_item_2_result }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3>7. In the box labeled Employee's Self-Assessment, write how you met each objective. Where possible, provide data to support how well you met the objective. Also, address how well you met each one of St. John's competencies.</h3>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>Employee's Self-Assessment</p>
    <img src="placeholder_icon_4.png" alt="Icon 4" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <p><strong>Employee's Self-Assessment</strong></p>
  <p>Objective #1 - <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_1">{{ self_assessment_objective_1 }}</span>. During the past review cycle, delivered <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_1_detail">{{ self_assessment_objective_1_detail }}</span>. This included <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_1_support">{{ self_assessment_objective_1_support }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Objective #2 - <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_2">{{ self_assessment_objective_2 }}</span>. During the past review cycle, delivered <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_2_detail">{{ self_assessment_objective_2_detail }}</span>. This included <span data-field="self_assessment_objective_2_support">{{ self_assessment_objective_2_support }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Competency #1 - <span data-field="self_assessment_competency_1">{{ self_assessment_competency_1 }}</span>. Demonstrated <span data-field="self_assessment_competency_1_detail">{{ self_assessment_competency_1_detail }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Competency #2 - <span data-field="self_assessment_competency_2">{{ self_assessment_competency_2 }}</span>. Demonstrated <span data-field="self_assessment_competency_2_detail">{{ self_assessment_competency_2_detail }}</span>.</p>

  <p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have not completed the self-assessment, and you wish to save it to work on at a later date, click on <span data-field="save_and_resume_link">{{ save_and_resume_link }}</span>. If you are finished with the self-assessment, click on <span data-field="submit_form_button">{{ submit_form_button }}</span> to submit the self-assessment to your supervisor.</p>

  <p>Nothing contained in this St. John's Performance Assessment alters the "at-will" nature of your employment, which means that both you and St. John's University may terminate the employment relationship at any time, with or without notice, reason or cause.</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <button style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #0056b3; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer;">Submit Form</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p><strong>9. Upon submission of your RED form and self-assessment to your supervisor, you will receive an email from the Office of Human Resources acknowledging completion of your form and informing you that your supervisor has the action to complete their section of the RED Form.</strong></p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>Recognize Excellence and Development Employee Self Assessment - 20</p>
    <img src="placeholder_email_screenshot.png" alt="Email Screenshot" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <p><strong>10. After your supervisor completes the ratings and supervisor's summary and submits the form, Formstack sends you and your supervisor an email that the Supervisor submitted their ratings and narrative to you, their employee, and transmits a sample copy of the RED Form.</strong></p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <p>RED Form Complete!</p>
    <img src="placeholder_email_submission_screenshot.png" alt="Submission Email Screenshot" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4>Next steps:</h4>
      <ol>
        <li>Supervisor and employee complete one-on-one meeting to discuss the employee's RED Form.</li>
        <li>After meeting is held, the supervisor signs the form and submits it to the employee for their countersignature.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>